### Consumer REST API — requires the consumer module running (default port 8080),
### with Kafka + Postgres containers up (retail-kafka, retail-postgres).
### Open this file with the "REST Client" VS Code extension and click "Send Request"
### above any block below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List stats for all tracked products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/products

### Get stats for a single product (adjust the id to one that actually exists)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/products/PRD-0001

### Aggregate summary across all tracked products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/summary
